        "name": "install_packages",
        "description": "Install missing helper Python dependencies into this WORKSPACE shared package directory, serialized by a cross-process workspace lock. Reuses the home-level pip cache; never uses sudo/--user. All Sessions in this workspace share these files. Try existing imports first; create fresh Pool processes after updating already-imported packages. This is not a project-venv installer.",
